    "StikDebug isn't meant to enable JIT for LiveContainer manually. Select StikDebug in LiveContainer settings, enable \"Run with JIT\" for your app, then open your app normally. It will automatically jump back here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不建议通过 StikDebug 手动为 LiveContainer 启用 JIT。请在 LiveContainer 设置中选择 StikDebug，为应用启用“使用 JIT 运行”，然后正常打开应用，它会自动跳转回这里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
